The statements above iterate the increment of​n as long as​n is less than or                
equal to 10. It keeps repeating until​n reaches 11, which is greater than 10. This                
causes the control expression to be evaluated as​false​, resulting in the termination of              
the ​while statement. However, if multiple controlled statements are needed, they can            
