Listing 11-4 demonstrates how to write a string given by an array of characters              
(​buf​) to a text file (​test.txt​). Since the open mode is “​w​”, the characters (​buf​) will be                 
written at the beginning of the file. The string “​C programming is fun.​” will be written                
